---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import { rel, SUPPORT_EMAIL, LEGAL_NAME } from '../../consts';
const description = `Privacy policy for Last Human: Dodge the Bots by ${LEGAL_NAME}.`;
---
<Base title="Privacy Policy · Last Human: Dodge the Bots" description={description} path="/privacy/last-human">
  <main class="page">
    <div class="wrap" style="max-width:720px;">
      <a class="back" href={rel('/privacy/')}>← All privacy policies</a>
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="updated">Last Human: Dodge the Bots · Last updated September 1, 2026</p>

      <p>
        <strong>Last Human is coming soon and not yet available on the App Store.</strong> This policy
        describes the app as designed and will be finalized against the shipped build before launch.
      </p>

      <h2>The short version</h2>
      <p>
        {LEGAL_NAME} is building Last Human as a free arcade game supported by ads, matching the privacy
        practice already shipped in our other apps. We don't plan to run accounts, analytics, or trackers
        of our own, and we won't see your personal information. Gameplay and high scores are designed to
        stay on your device.
      </p>

      <h2>What stays on your device</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Your persistent high score.</li>
        <li>Your app settings, including purchase/ads state.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        This information is designed to be stored locally on your device. We do not plan to receive it.
        Deleting the app removes local app data from your device.
      </p>

      <h2>Advertising (Google AdMob)</h2>
      <p>
        The free version is planned to show an interstitial ad between levels. Ads are expected to be
        served by <strong>Google AdMob</strong>, a third-party advertising network — the same provider
        used across our other apps. To serve ads, Google may collect a device identifier for advertising
        purposes; this is not linked to your identity and is not used to track you across other apps or
        websites. We do not receive, store, or link any of this to you.
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>How Google uses this data is described in <a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/ads">Google's advertising policy</a> and <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy">Google's privacy policy</a>.</li>
        <li>The planned Remove Ads purchase ($0.99) would remove ads from the app.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Children</h2>
      <p>
        We do not plan to knowingly collect any data from anyone, including children under 13. There are
        no accounts, profiles, or in-app messaging planned for this app.
      </p>

      <h2>Changes</h2>
      <p>
        This policy will be updated to match the shipped app before Last Human launches, and any material
        change after that will be posted at this URL with an updated date above.
      </p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>Questions? Email <a href={`mailto:${SUPPORT_EMAIL}`}>{SUPPORT_EMAIL}</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </main>
</Base>
